PSGC dataset derived from the npm package `psgc` v2.2.0 (MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2021 Patrick Ofilada). Data snapshot of the Philippine Standard
Geographic Code; source data is a 2021 snapshot of the official PSGC.
Upstream: https://github.com/pcofilada/psgc
Refresh path: the official PSGC (Philippine Statistics Authority) publishes
quarterly updates; before launch this snapshot may be replaced with a newer
one extracted from a current `psgc` npm release.

